<title>USA: Gencor Industries sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Gencor Industries sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gencor Industries Inc said Wednesday its board of directors authorized a two-for-one split of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The split will be payable May 30 to shareholders of record May 19, the company said.</p>
</text>
